---
/*
 * The masthead. Just the name, linking home.
 *
 * It used to carry the apparatus of a survey sheet: a specification list, a
 * scale bar, a north arrow, a sheet number and edition, a live count, and a
 * vertical strapline. Every one of those was fiction - the sheet has no
 * projection, datum or scale, the sheet number was a filter index and the
 * edition a date arithmetic. They read as authority, carried none, and cost
 * the top of every page.
 */
---
<div class="border-b-2 border-(--color-rule) px-5 py-4">
  <a href="/" class="block font-[family-name:--font-display] text-[2.1rem] font-bold uppercase leading-[0.95] tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-[2.6rem]">
    Techno Optimists
  </a>
</div>
